 "description": "Food-derived medium: metabolizable components of Saffron (Crocus sativus) [Herbs and Spices] from FooDB, plus a standard M9 mineral base. Organic components use presence-based uptake bounds; FooDB content retained. Measured compounds with no BiGG exchange are listed under uncovered.",
